<figure class="analysis-framework" aria-labelledby="analysis-framework-title">
	<header class="analysis-framework-heading">
		<p class="section-kicker">Analytical framework</p>
		<h2 id="analysis-framework-title">Digital delivery platforms reshape local food environments through both geographic reach and the composition of available food choices.</h2>
	</header>

	<div class="framework-trunk" aria-hidden="true"><span>Digital food retail environment</span></div>

	<div class="framework-branches">
		<article class="framework-branch">
			<header>
				<span>01</span>
				<div>
					<p>Retail network extension</p>
					<h3>How do digital delivery platforms add to the geographic reach of retailer-owned delivery networks?</h3>
				</div>
			</header>

			<div class="framework-flow reach-flow" aria-label="Geographic reach analysis">
				<div class="framework-inputs">
					<span>Retailer-owned delivery</span>
					<span>Digital delivery platforms</span>
				</div>
				<b aria-hidden="true">↓</b>
				<strong>Shared small-area geography</strong>
				<b aria-hidden="true">↓</b>
				<div class="framework-outputs">
					<span>Coverage overlap</span>
					<span>Additional observed reach</span>
					<span>Connected-patch morphology</span>
				</div>
			</div>
		</article>

		<article class="framework-branch">
			<header>
				<span>02</span>
				<div>
					<p>Inequality in available food choice</p>
					<h3>How does digital fast-food exposure vary with deprivation and rurality?</h3>
				</div>
			</header>

			<div class="framework-flow choice-flow" aria-label="Available food choice analysis">
				<div class="framework-inputs">
					<span>Deliverable food restaurants</span>
					<span>Fast-food classification</span>
				</div>
				<b aria-hidden="true">↓</b>
				<strong>Count · density · share</strong>
				<b aria-hidden="true">↓</b>
				<div class="framework-outputs">
					<span>Deprivation</span>
					<span>Rurality</span>
					<span>Scale and composition</span>
				</div>
			</div>
		</article>
	</div>

	<figcaption>
		Coverage establishes whether delivery reaches a place; composition describes the food environment available through that market.
	</figcaption>
</figure>
